    "message": "fix(examples): todo renderResult returns undefined on validation errors\n\nWhen a todo call fails schema validation, createErrorToolResult produces\ndetails: {} (a truthy empty object), so renderResult skips both the\n!details and details.error branches, then switch (details.action) has no\ndefault and returns undefined. ToolExecutionComponent.updateDisplay()\nthen calls addChild(undefined), and the next Box.render pass crashes the\nwhole interactive TUI.\n\nAdd a default case that renders the validation error text.",
